    "description": "SECZ is the SEC-registered blockchain-native common stock of Securitize Holdings, Inc. (NYSE: SECZ), issued and settled natively on Solana (Token-2022) and Avalanche (permissioned ERC-20) in parallel with the traditional NYSE listing that debuted on 2026-07-02 following a business combination with Cantor Equity Partners II. On-chain and off-chain shares are equivalent primary representations of ownership, with Securitize Transfer Agent, LLC (SEC-registered) maintaining the official register and enabling movement between book-entry and on-chain positions. Access requires KYC verification. Approximately $266 million in tokenized shares landed on-chain at debut, the largest tokenized public stock at launch.",
